ser sandbox. Code that cannot be\ntrusted with the configured child origin and browser permissions belongs in a more restrictive\nexecution system or separate application boundary."},"1362":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment-103","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment#verification","content":"`pnpm exec vitest run packages/core/test/iframe.test.ts` verifies origin rejection, sandbox\nrequirements, protocol validation, RPC cancellation/timeouts, capability negotiation, lifecycle,\nrollback, and agent shutdown."},"1363":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment-104","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment#verification","content":"`pnpm exec playwright test e2e/vertical-slice.spec.ts` verifies a real cross-origin iframe agent,\nindependent child MF runtime, readiness, updates, navigation service RPC, and browser cleanup."},"1364":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment-105","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment#verification","content":"`examples/react-host/src/runtime.ts` is the parent wiring\nreference."},"1365":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment-106","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment#verification","content":"`examples/iframe-remote/src/index.ts` is the child agent\nwiring reference."},"1366":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment-107","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment#verification","content":"Human review is required for production origins, CSP, iframe permissions, cookie policy, exposed\ncapabilities, and service-side authorization; repository tests cannot prove deployment headers."},"1367":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-deployment-108","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/iframe-dep