in Vite Host. The Host\ndoes not install any federation build plugin: it creates an official runtime instance and passes it\nto `@fronts/mf`."},"1551":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-77","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#official-rsbuild-and-vite-producers","content":"These are the preferred MF producer paths. Both emit a manifest consumed by the official runtime.\nA manifest is preferred over a raw entry because it preserves metadata used by official preloading,\nsnapshot, type-hinting, and DevTools features. Fronts consumes none of those internals directly."},"1552":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-78","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#official-rsbuild-and-vite-producers","content":"The repository proves:"},"1553":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-79","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#official-rsbuild-and-vite-producers","content":"React and Vue applications exposed through the official Rsbuild plugin;"},"1554":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-80","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#official-rsbuild-and-vite-producers","content":"a framework-neutral application exposed through the official Vite plugin;"},"1555":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-81","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#official-rsbuild-and-vite-producers","content":"mount, framework readiness, updates, host services, and unmount;"},"1556":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-82","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#official-rsbuild-and-vite-producers","content":"DOM, Shadow DOM, and cross-origin iframe execution across the full example suite."},"1557":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-83","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#vite-plugin-federation","content":"The unscoped plugin is supported as a compatible producer, not as the Fronts Host runtime. Its\nfixture emits `mf-manifest.json`, and the Host consumes that manifest through its own official\nruntime instance. The plugin's bundled runtime MUST NOT be passed to `@fronts/mf`."},"1558":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-84","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#vite-plugin-federation","content":"Both the Vite development server and a fresh production preview are exercised by the same lifecycle\nE2E. This claim is limited to the manifest producer path checked into this repository."},"1559":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-85","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#originjs","content":"OriginJS is a deliberately narrow compatibility fixture:"},"1560":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-86","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#originjs","content":"the remote is built as ESM and consumed from `assets/remoteEntry.js`;"},"1561":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-87","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#originjs","content":"its `dev` script builds and previews output because a bundleless remote dev mode is unavailable;"},"1562":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-88","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#originjs","content":"the fixture stays on Vite 5.4 because its current output transform is not compatible with this\nrepository's Vite 8/Rolldown producer pipeline;"},"1563":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-89","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#originjs","content":"its generated `@fronts/core` fallback is retained and verified through share-scope initialization;"},"1564":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-90","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#originjs","content":"the OriginJS `virtual:__federation__` Host API is not used or supported by Fronts."},"1565":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-91","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#originjs","content":"This does not claim compatibility with SystemJS/`var` output, OriginJS as the Host loader, or newer\nVite pipelines. Expanding the claim requires a dedicated fixture and both lifecycle and shared\ndependency verification."},"1566":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-92","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#dependency-choices","content":"Use case"},"1567":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-93","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#dependency-choices","content":"Consumer dependencies"},"1568":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-94","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#dependency-choices","content":"Fronts without Module Federation"},"1569":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-95","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#dependency-choices","content":"`@fronts/core`"},"1570":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-96","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[