ime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#adding-another-producer","content":"CORS and public asset URLs work from a distinct Host origin."},"1586":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-112","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#adding-another-producer","content":"The matrix records the exact evidence boundary instead of generalizing from one successful load."},"1587":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-113","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#adding-another-producer","content":"No new Fronts Runtime API is required merely to support another conforming producer artifact."},"1588":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-114","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#verification","content":"`pnpm exec vitest run packages/mf/test` verifies source validation, official instance calls, immutable\nremote binding, preload mapping, cancellation, and real remote-container loading."},"1589":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-115","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#verification","content":"`pnpm test:e2e` verifies the complete matrix against development server commands."},"1590":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-116","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#verification","content":"`pnpm test:e2e:preview` rebuilds every producer and verifies the matrix against production output;\nthis is the browser path run by CI."},"1591":{"id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation-117","page_id":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/runtime/module-federation#verification","content":"`e2e/vite-runtime.spec.ts` proves