-started","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started#组合本地-host","content":"组合本地 Host"},"6":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started#加入-module-federation-交付","content":"加入 Module Federation 交付"},"7":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started#验证仓库-checkout","content":"验证仓库 checkout"},"8":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started","content":"Fronts 2.0 目前只能从本仓库使用，尚未发布到 npm。以下安装命令表达正式发布后的预期用法；\n第一个 prerelease 发布前，请通过 workspace 或 Git 依赖进行评估，不要把示例版本当成已发布承诺。"},"9":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started#选择依赖组合","content":"Vite remote 还要选择一个 producer 插件。官方 `@module-federation/vite` 拥有最完整的 Fronts\nfixture；`vite-plugin-federation` 通过 MF2 manifest 路径验证；OriginJS 则是刻意收窄的、仅生产\n构建的 ESM `remoteEntry.js` 兼容路径。"},"10":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started#定义应用","content":"React 与 Vue producer 分别使用 `defineReactApp()` 和 `defineVueApp()`，但导出的仍是同一个带\n协议品牌的应用契约，因此 Host 不需要成为某个框架的特殊模式。"},"11":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started#组合本地-host","content":"Shell、producer 本地开发页、Storybook 和集成测试都应复用这套 Host transaction。Fronts 2.0\n没有另一套全局注册机制，也不需要一个行为不同的 standalone 生命周期 API。"},"12":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started#加入-module-federation-交付","content":"显式创建官方 Runtime instance，再把它传给 `@fronts/mf`。适配器把一次已经解析的部署映射到\n公开的 `registerRemotes()`、`preloadRemote()` 与 `loadRemote()`；它不拥有 manifest，也不\n接管 share graph。"},"13":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started#加入-module-federation-交付","content":"继续阅读 Host Runtime API，了解取消、基于解析结果的容器、\n上下文服务、替换、审计与关闭。在宣称 producer 兼容前，请阅读\nModule Federation 集成中的验证矩阵和限制。"},"14":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started#验证仓库-checkout","content":"非浏览器门禁会构建并打包所有公开软件包，通过 ESM 与 CommonJS 导入 tarball，执行 workspace\n类型检查并强制覆盖率。两套浏览器模式分别证明开发态组合与全新生产产物，不能互相替代。"},"15":{"id":"/zh/docs","page_id":"/zh/docs","type":"page","content":"Fronts 2.0 文档","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs"},"16":{"id":"/zh/docs-0","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs","content":"了解框架无关的应用契约、Host Runtime、交付集成、隔离边界、运行维护与发布策略。"},"17":{"id":"/zh/docs-1","page_id":"/zh/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"选择正确的层"},"18":{"id":"/zh/docs-2","page_id":"/zh/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs#推荐阅读顺序","content":"推荐阅读顺序"},"19":{"id":"/zh/docs-3","page_id":"/zh/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs#仓库实际证明了什么","content":"仓库实际证明了什么"},"20":{"id":"/zh/docs-4","page_id":"/zh/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs#文档来源与权威性","content":"文档来源与权威性"},"21":{"id":"/zh/docs-5","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs","content":"Fronts 是一个面向独立交付 Web 应用的、框架无关的**应用运行时**。模块加载器解决“如何取得代码”，\nFronts 从下一层问题开始：平台如何为应用提供稳定 ABI、可信身份、生命周期所有权、部署策略、隔离、\n最小权限宿主能力、就绪判断、原子替换、取消、可观测性和确定性清理。"},"22":{"id":"/zh/docs-6","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs","content":"Fronts 2.0 已实现并经过测试，但尚未发布到 npm。第一次稳定版发布前，公开 API 与协议仍可能调整。"},"23":{"id":"/zh/docs-7","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"需求"},"24":{"id":"/zh/docs-8","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"建议使用"},"25":{"id":"/zh/docs-9","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"加载 MF remote，或使用官方 React/Vue Bridge"},"26":{"id":"/zh/docs-10","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"直接使用 Module Federation Runtime 或 Bridge"},"27":{"id":"/zh/docs-11","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"不通过 Module Federation 运行 Fronts 应用"},"28":{"id":"/zh/docs-12","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"`@fronts/core` 加任意应用 loader"},"29":{"id":"/zh/docs-13","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"通过 MF Runtime 加载 Fronts 应用"},"30":{"id":"/zh/docs-14","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"`@fronts/core`、`@fronts/mf` 与 `@module-federation/runtime`"},"31":{"id":"/zh/docs-15","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"构建 MF producer"},"32":{"id":"/zh/docs-16","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"官方 Vite、Rsbuild 等受支持的 producer 插件"},"33":{"id":"/zh/docs-17","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"跨框架、loader、隔离级别和发布策略治理应用"},"34":{"id":"/zh/docs-18","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"Fronts Host"},"35":{"id":"/zh/docs-19","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择正确的层","content":"Fronts 不解析 MF manifest，不选择 shared dependency，不修改 snapshot，也不替代 bundler 插件；\n这些职责继续属于 Module Federation。"},"36":{"id":"/zh/docs-20","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#推荐阅读顺序","content":"快速开始：定义并挂载第一个应用。"},"37":{"id":"/zh/docs-21","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#推荐阅读顺序","content":"决策记录：理解 MF 2 之后 Fronts 为什么仍有价值。"},"38":{"id":"/zh/docs-22","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#推荐阅读顺序","content":"架构：掌握分层和所有权边界。"},"39":{"id":"/zh/docs-23","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#推荐阅读顺序","content":"应用契约：掌握 producer ABI。"},"40":{"id":"/zh/docs-24","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#推荐阅读顺序","content":"Host Runtime API：组合并运行一个 Host。"},"41":{"id":"/zh/docs-25","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#推荐阅读顺序","content":"Module Federation 集成：选择已经验证的交付路径。"},"42":{"id":"/zh/docs-26","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#仓库实际证明了什么","content":"仓库验证了仅使用 core 的完整生命周期、通过官方 MF Runtime 加载真实 remote、React 与 Vue\nproducer、DOM 与 Shadow DOM 目标、跨源 iframe agent、就绪门控替换、上下文能力服务，以及多种\n兼容 Vite producer。开发服务器和全新 production preview 两套浏览器测试运行同一份应用契约。"},"43":{"id":"/zh/docs-27","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#仓库实际证明了什么","content":"请通过支持策略区分“声明支持”“CI 验证”“fixture 验证”\n“尽力兼容”和“不支持”，避免把一个可构建示例误当作长期兼容承诺。"},"44":{"id":"/zh/docs-28","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#文档来源与权威性","content":"英文技术页面由仓库的规范 Markdown 与各软件包 README 自动生成；中文页面具有完全相同的 slug\n目录，并通过结构、链接和内容完整性检查。精确 TypeScript 签名和依赖范围以源代码及 package\nmanifest 为最终依据；本站负责解释设计意图、边界、工作流与验证证据。"},"45":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","type":"page","content":"应用契约","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","核心概念","核心概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract"},"46":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","content":"Fronts 2.0 的框架无关应用协议、生命周期所有权、就绪、服务和兼容规则。"},"47":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#协议身份","content":"协议身份"},"48":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#mount-输入","content":"Mount 输入"},"49":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#mount-输出与就绪","content":"Mount 输出与就绪"},"50":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#状态机与取消","content":"状态机与取消"},"51":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#capability-与实例服务","content":"Capability 与实例服务"},"52":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#框架适配器与兼容规则","content":"框架适配器与兼容规则"},"53":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#验证","content":"验证"},"54":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#协议身份","content":"每个 producer 都导出由 `defineApp()`、`defineReactApp()` 或 `defineVueApp()` 创建的\n`FrontsApp`。helper 添加不可枚举的 symbol brand，并公开可枚举的协议名称和版本。symbol 只是\n同一 JavaScript realm 内的标记；跨 package ABI 是结构化 mount shape、协议名称和 major 版本。\nHost 始终验证 ABI，symbol 不能绕过协议版本检查。"},"55":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#协议身份","content":"Module Federation expose 通常导出默认应用："},"56":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#协议身份","content":"默认 expose 为 `./application`，也可在 `AppRef` 中显式选择其他 expose。"},"57":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#mount-输入","content":"`instanceId` 在挂载事务或 retained record 存在期间唯一。Host 在事务开始时捕获 props 引用，\n但不深拷贝也不冻结调用者对象，双方必须把它当作只读输入。services 只包含应用声明且被 Host\n授权的能力；signal 在取消或强制 abort 时触发；target 由当前容器提供并控制。producer 只能在\ntarget 内渲染，除非通过已声明的平台 capability 明确取得其他副作用权限。"},"58":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#mount-输出与就绪","content":"`mount()` 表示应用已接受资源，`ready` 表示可用 UI 已提交；省略 `ready` 时，mount 返回即视为\n就绪。首次渲染失败必须让 ready reject，不能等待可选 analytics、后台任务或不一定发生的交互。\n替换事务只有在候选 ready 后才能提交。"},"59":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#mount-输出与就绪","content":"`update()` 在身份、部署、target、service scope 不变的情况下更新 props；不支持时 Host 报 typed\nlifecycle error，不会悄悄 remount。`activate()`/`deactivate()` 是可选活动提示，必须保留状态，\n适合暂停 timer、subscription、media 或昂贵渲染。`unmount()` 必须存在，并释放 render root、\nlistener、timer、observer、subscription 和 producer DOM；container element 由 adapter 清理。"},"60":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#状态机与取消","content":"每个实例的操作串行执行；当前状态不允许的调用会以 `FrontsError` 拒绝，不会跨 destruction 隐式排队。\n外部 mount signal 与实例 signal 合并，任一 abort 都阻止新阶段并触发回滚。resolver/loader 应继续\n把 signal 传给网络请求。取消是协作式的：同 realm 已执行的 JavaScript 无法强制停止；需要更强\n隔离时使用 iframe，并在必要时销毁 child realm。"},"61":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#capability-与实例服务","content":"应用用字符串声明所需能力："},"62":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#capability-与实例服务","content":"声明是必要条件而非授权。`capabilityPolicy` 针对具体 identity 判断每个 key，并收到 instance\nsignal；取消时 runtime 会停止等待异步授权。能力不存在或被拒绝会让普通挂载失败；未声明 service\n永远不会进入 facade。清理时 facade 先 revoke，因此应用即使保留 method proxy 也不能继续影响 Host。"},"63":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#capability-与实例服务","content":"静态 `services` 适合简单情况；需要绑定 identity、tenant、trace 或资源时使用 `createServices`："},"64":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#capability-与实例服务","content":"provider 每个 mount/replace 事务只运行一次。它返回的同名服务覆盖静态服务，之后 Host 才做可用性\n与 policy 检查。返回即把所有权交给 Host；`dispose` 最多调用一次，覆盖授权失败、取消、普通卸载和\nshutdown。若 provider 在返回前抛错，它仍负责清理自己已分配但尚未移交的资源。"},"65":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#capability-与实例服务","content":"iframe 中，proxy 配置的 capability 是 Host 控制的最大集合，不是最终 grant。child agent 加载\n真实应用后协商声明子集，只有精确交集生成 RPC stub，父端每次调用还会复核 grant；child 自己声明\n但 offer 中不存在的能力仍会拒绝挂载。应优先提供 `navigation.go()`、`telemetry.emit()` 这类窄意图\nAPI，而不是 `window`、整个 Redux store 或泛化全局 event bus。"},"66":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#框架适配器与兼容规则","content":"`defineReactApp()` 管理 React root、context、error boundary、commit-based readiness、props\n更新、可选 Strict Mode 和卸载；`defineVueApp()` 管理 Vue app、provide context、reactive props、\n`nextTick()` readiness、configure hook 和卸载。它们刻意少于官方 MF Bridge 的路由、数据、SSR\n功能：需要这些能力时直接用 Bridge，需要参与 Fronts Host ABI 时才用 Fronts adapter。"},"67":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#框架适配器与兼容规则","content":"协议 major 严格匹配。Host 必须拒绝未知 major，不能猜测行为；新增可选 handle method 可以兼容，\n改变 mount 语义、readiness、服务授权或 cleanup 所有权必须提升 protocol major。"},"68":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/application-contract#验证","content":"`packages/core/test/app.test.ts` 与 `host.test.ts` 验证品牌、校验、顺序、就绪和清理；\n`services.test.ts` 与 `iframe.test.ts` 验证 service scope、provider cleanup 和 iframe 协商；\nReact/Vue package 测试证明两个 producer 实现相同契约。"},"69":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","type":"page","content":"Fronts 2.0 架构","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","核心概念","核心概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture"},"70":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","content":"运行时分层、所有权边界、依赖方向、挂载与替换事务，以及显式扩展点。"},"71":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#系统边界","content":"系统边界"},"72":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#依赖规则","content":"依赖规则"},"73":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#核心抽象","content":"核心抽象"},"74":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"与 Module Federation 2 的所有权对照"},"75":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#host-挂载事务","content":"Host 挂载事务"},"76":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#替换事务","content":"替换事务"},"77":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#扩展点与验证","content":"扩展点与验证"},"78":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#系统边界","content":"Fronts 把逻辑应用引用变成受治理的应用实例。它刻意分层，让发布策略、代码传输、渲染框架和\n执行隔离可以独立演进："},"79":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#依赖规则","content":"依赖只能向内：`@fronts/core` 不依赖框架、bundler 或 Module Federation；`@fronts/mf` 依赖 core，\n并把公开的 `@module-federation/runtime` 声明为 peer；React/Vue3 包依赖 core，并 peer 对应框架。\n示例负责组合软件包，软件包不能反向导入示例或平台策略。"},"80":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#依赖规则","content":"任何 Fronts 源码都不得导入 `@module-federation/runtime-core` 私有边界。公开 Runtime package\n是兼容契约；纯运行时 consumer 可直接依赖 `@module-federation/runtime`，不必引入 build plugin。"},"81":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#核心抽象","content":"`AppRef` 是逻辑请求：name、expose、可选语义版本范围和 channel，不含 CDN URL。"},"82":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#核心抽象","content":"`ResolveContext` 携带 environment、tenant、cohort、metadata，以及不可变 operation envelope；\nHost 不解释业务策略字段，resolver/registry 才负责选版本。"},"83":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#核心抽象","content":"`ResolvedApp<Source>` 是不可变决策，包含规范化引用、opaque transport source、已选版本和 metadata。"},"84":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#核心抽象","content":"`AppLoader<Source>` 负责 `load()` 与可选 `preload()`，返回 unknown module；Host 随后验证协议。"},"85":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#核心抽象","content":"`ContainerAdapter` 准备执行目标并拥有清理，还能为 iframe 等容器选择专用 loader。"},"86":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#核心抽象","content":"`FrontsApp` 是框架无关 producer contract；React/Vue 只是生成该契约的适配器。"},"87":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#核心抽象","content":"`FrontsHost` 是有状态编排器，串起解析、加载、验证、service scope、容器、挂载、就绪、替换、\n事件、审计与回收。"},"88":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"能力"},"89":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"MF 2"},"90":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"Fronts"},"91":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"Manifest/Snapshot、资源图"},"92":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"拥有"},"93":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tag