ace"},"103":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"官方 Bridge render/destroy"},"104":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"Bridge 拥有"},"105":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"只拥有自身 ABI adapter"},"106":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"逻辑应用到部署的业务策略"},"107":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"不规定"},"108":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"resolver contract 拥有"},"109":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"跨 transport 生命周期"},"110":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"不规定"},"111":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"拥有"},"112":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"DOM/Shadow/iframe 策略"},"113":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"不规定"},"114":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"拥有"},"115":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"Host service 授权、就绪替换、泄漏审计"},"116":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"不规定"},"117":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"拥有"},"118":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#与-module-federation-2-的所有权对照","content":"URL 重写、manifest fetch、script/link 创建、shared resolution 和 remote-load fallback 应使用\nMF runtime plugin；环境、租户、cohort、channel 等业务部署选择使用 Fronts resolver。混合两类\n职责会让缓存、回滚和观测都难以推理。"},"119":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#host-挂载事务","content":"Host 按顺序执行：规范化引用并生成 operation/identity/trace ID；解析部署；若配置了动态容器则\n根据 `resolved` 生成 container request，随后选择默认或容器专用 loader；加载并验证应用协议；\n为当前实例创建服务、授权声明的 capability 并构造可撤销 facade；准备容器；调用 `mount()`；\n在 deadline 内等待 `ready`；最后才把实例发布为可用。"},"120":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#host-挂载事务","content":"任何阶段失败都会以确定顺序回滚已经取得的资源。原始异常保持为主错误，清理异常通过带 phase 的\nFronts error 和事件另行呈现，不会覆盖根因。"},"121":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#替换事务","content":"`replace(currentId, nextOptions)` 不是修改运行中的 MF cache。Host 先在目标内创建隐藏 staging\nslot，解析并挂载候选部署；候选未 ready 时失败，只销毁 staging，当前实例继续服务；候选 ready\n后先提交新 slot，再卸载旧实例。旧实例清理失败单独返回，不能伪装成新应用未就绪。同一实例的并发\n替换会被拒绝，从而保持清楚的事务边界。"},"122":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#扩展点与验证","content":"可以实现 `AppResolver` 接 registry、`ResolutionCache` 接共享缓存、resolution-aware container\n按 metadata 选择 iframe origin、`AppLoader` 接非 MF transport、`ContainerAdapter` 接新目标，\n或把 `HostEvent` 映射到 OpenTelemetry。用 `createServices` 创建实例绑定能力并确定性释放，用\n`capabilityPolicy` 按 identity、tenant、deployment 授权。所有扩展点都是显式对象，不是进程全局变量。"},"123":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/architecture#扩展点与验证","content":"`pnpm check` 验证包边界、公开 exports、类型、生命周期和覆盖率；`pnpm test:e2e` 与\n`pnpm test:e2e:preview` 分别验证开发服务和全新生产产物。源码权威边界位于\n`packages/core/src` 与\n`packages/mf/src`。"},"124":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","type":"page","content":"MF 2 之后的 Fronts 2.0","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","核心概念","核心概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record"},"125":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","content":"保留 Fronts 应用运行时的决策、替代方案、所有权边界、非目标与发布条件。"},"126":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策","content":"决策"},"127":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#官方-bridge-的重叠","content":"官方 Bridge 的重叠"},"128":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"决策矩阵"},"129":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#已接受的所有权边界","content":"已接受的所有权边界"},"130":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#发布条件","content":"发布条件"},"131":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#验证","content":"验证"},"132":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","content":"状态：Fronts 2.0 alpha 已接受。最近复核日期为 2026-07-13，基线是 Module Federation 2.7\n和本地提供的 `module-federation/core` 源码提交\n`37c97f6ec`。"},"133":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策","content":"Fronts 2.0 有独立价值，但前提是它不重复 Module Federation 已成熟的能力。MF 已经提供独立\nRuntime、manifest/snapshot、预加载、Runtime Plugin、动态类型、DevTools、shared 选择，以及\nReact/Vue Bridge。若 Fronts 再包装 `remoteEntry`、自建 shared resolver、重写 bundler plugin，\n或只是给 React remote app 换一个名字，它就会变成脆弱的官方 Runtime 分叉。"},"134":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策","content":"仍然存在的空白位于更高一层：企业宿主需要把“一个远程模块”提升为“一个可治理的应用实例”。\n这包括稳定生命周期、租户与发布策略、多种隔离容器、最小权限宿主能力、就绪门控替换、回滚、\n取消和跨框架观测。MF 负责可靠取得模块，应用级策略不应反向塞入 MF。"},"135":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策","content":"因此 Fronts 2.0 是位于 Module Federation 之上、传输无关且框架无关的 application runtime\n与 orchestration layer；它既不是另一个 MF Runtime，也不是完整微前端云平台。"},"136":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#官方-bridge-的重叠","content":"官方 React Bridge 已能导出、加载、渲染和销毁完整 React 应用，并提供路由与数据预取；Vue 3\nBridge 方向相同。若系统只有 React/Vue + MF 且不需要平台治理，应直接使用官方 Bridge。"},"137":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#官方-bridge-的重叠","content":"`@fronts/react` 和 `@fronts/vue3` 是 Fronts ABI producer，而不是 Bridge 替代品。Fronts 的\n合理性必须由框架无关 Host、resolver、隔离容器、capability scope、替换事务和治理能力共同证明。\n以后可以提供 Bridge ↔ Fronts ABI 适配器，但 core 不应依赖 Bridge 内部实现。"},"138":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"场景"},"139":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"建议"},"140":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"加载共享工具函数或组件"},"141":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"直接用 MF Runtime"},"142":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"官方 Bridge 已满足 React/Vue 应用"},"143":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"使用 MF Bridge"},"144":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"单框架、同信任域、固定 remote 地址"},"145":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"通常不需要 Fronts"},"146":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"跨框架统一挂载、更新和清理"},"147":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"Fronts"},"148":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"按环境、租户、cohort 或 channel 选版本"},"149":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"Fronts resolver + 外部 registry"},"150":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"DOM、Shadow DOM、iframe 使用统一 Host API"},"151":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"Fronts container"},"152":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"根据应用声明和策略裁剪宿主 API"},"153":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"Fronts service scope"},"154":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"候选 ready 后才切换，失败保留当前应用"},"155":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#决策矩阵","content":"Fronts replacement transaction"},"156":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#已接受的所有权边界","content":"Fronts 负责应用 ABI（`mount → ready → update/activate/deactivate → unmount`）、实例状态与取消、\n不可变部署解析、容器选择、scoped service、就绪门控替换、生命周期事件、泄漏审计和框架适配。"},"157":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#已接受的所有权边界","content":"Module Federation 继续负责 remote 注册、manifest/snapshot、expose 和资源加载、预加载、shared\n依赖选择、Runtime Plugin 与底层 hook、类型产物、DevTools 和 bundler 集成。"},"158":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#已接受的所有权边界","content":"MVP 明确不做新的 bundler plugin、shared resolver、MF 全局 snapshot 修改、第三方 CSS 重排、\n完整 JavaScript sandbox、registry SaaS、router 替代、SSR/RSC 应用编排和隐式全局事件总线。"},"159":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#发布条件","content":"只有以下条件同时成立才值得发布：`@fronts/mf` 仅使用官方公开 Runtime API；core 不依赖框架、\nbundler；每种容器和失败阶段都有契约测试；真实 Runtime 能加载真实 remote；替换失败不会破坏\n当前实例；iframe 不使用通配 `targetOrigin`；capability 约束可见服务；所有公开 subpath 可通过\nESM 和 CommonJS 导入；清空产物后安装、构建、测试、发布检查可以重复通过。"},"160":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#发布条件","content":"如果官方 Runtime/Bridge 未来完整吸收这些职责，Fronts 应缩小甚至退役，而不是为项目存在而复制能力。"},"161":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/decision-record#验证","content":"MF 集成矩阵、\nHost Runtime API、\n应用契约和\n隔离模型把保留职责映射到公开契约。`pnpm check`、开发态\nE2E 与 production preview E2E 验证可执行条件；发布与人工安全门禁记录在运维文档中。"},"162":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","type":"page","content":"在 GitHub Pages 上部署 Fumadocs 静态站","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","核心概念","核心概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision"},"163":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","content":"在 main 构建显式双语静态路由，并以单个根提交替换 gh-pages 的架构决策。"},"164":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#背景","content":"背景"},"165":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#决策","content":"决策"},"166":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#评估过的方案","content":"评估过的方案"},"167":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#结果与代价","content":"结果与代价"},"168":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#安全运行与验证","content":"安全、运行与验证"},"169":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#背景","content":"Fronts 需要与当前 2.0 实现一致的中英文文档，但不能让 package 发布依赖文档服务器。自定义域名已经\n指向 GitHub Pages，现有 branch 却是六年前生成的 Docusaurus 产物。npm package release 仍以\n`master` 为源，而文档站按明确要求以 `main` 为 source branch。"},"170":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#背景","content":"网站需要嵌套技术导航、MDX、diagram、source link、本地化搜索、纯静态 hosting、确定性部署，以及能\n证明线上实际对应哪个源码提交的机制。"},"171":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#决策","content":"使用 Fumadocs 与 Next.js `output: 'export'`。源码位于 `main` 的 `website` pnpm workspace；package\npublication 继续在 `master`。语言使用显式 `/en` 和 `/zh`，通过目录 content parser 构建，不做隐式\nfallback。搜索在 build 时生成 Orama 静态 endpoint，中文使用 Mandarin tokenizer。"},"172":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#决策","content":"每次部署把 `website/out` 发布成 `gh-pages` 上没有 parent 的新 commit。逐字节保留当前 `CNAME`，\n增加 `.nojekyll`，并用绑定到已 fetch remote SHA 的 `force-with-lease` push。所有应用 HTML 嵌入完整\n`main` revision，脚本轮询 custom domain，直到新 revision 真正出现才成功。"},"173":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#评估过的方案","content":"保留旧 Docusaurus：内容和 provenance 都不能代表 Fronts 2.0，拒绝。"},"174":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#评估过的方案","content":"为每页手工维护两份英文/中文：canonical English 会漂移；采用 source mapping + 显式中文。"},"175":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#评估过的方案","content":"middleware、cookie 或 redirect 自动选语言：静态 Pages 无可靠 server negotiation，显式 URL 更稳定。"},"176":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#评估过的方案","content":"保留长期 gh-pages generated history：评审价值在 main；单一 root commit 更直接证明 live tree。"},"177":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#评估过的方案","content":"只用 Pages artifact：不满足保留 branch-visible CNAME 与静态输出的明确要求。"},"178":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#评估过的方案","content":"把文档塞进 package release workflow：两者权限、rollback 和 cadence 不同，保持独立。"},"179":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#结果与代价","content":"静态导出后网站不需要服务器，复用当前域名，并能从一个已评审 source commit 重现。canonical English\n变化自动进入 generated tree；中文仍是明确的人工维护责任。独立 workflow 只需 contents write，不扩大\nnpm OIDC/release secret 权限。"},"180":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#结果与代价","content":"由于生成 branch 刻意 rewrite，它不是 durable rollback history。恢复方式是 checkout 一个已知良好的\n`main` revision，重新构建并发布另一个 root commit。Orama 与 Mermaid 必须保持 static export 兼容。\n增加语言不只是 label，还需要 inventory、tokenizer、navigation、metadata、output check 和 browser evidence。"},"181":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#安全运行与验证","content":"部署脚本拒绝 dirty、未 push 或非 main source；exact lease 防止静默覆盖并发 Pages 更新；它从当前 remote\ncommit 读取 CNAME，并在 push 前逐字节对比新 blob。在线 revision polling 区分“git push 成功”和\n“Pages 已发布”。首次 rollout 仍需人工检查 Pages branch/root 配置、domain/TLS、root commit、语言导航\n和公开文章渲染。"},"182":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/documentation-website-decision#安全运行与验证","content":"`pnpm website:check` 验证内容、MDX/TypeScript、static export、link、asset、search 与浏览器行为；\n`scripts/deploy-website.mjs` 验证 branch/source、CNAME、parentless commit、lease、remote SHA 与线上 revision；\n`.github/workflows/docs.yml` 在 Node 24 + Chromium 上从 main 执行。"},"183":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","type":"page","content":"@fronts/core","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","软件包","软件包"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/core"},"184":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core","content":"框架无关的应用协议、Host Runtime、resolver、container、service、错误与 iframe 入口。"},"185":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#定义应用","content":"定义应用"},"186":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#创建-host","content":"创建 Host"},"187":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#公开能力面","content":"公开能力面"},"188":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core","content":"`@fronts/core` 是 Fronts 2.0 的框架与 transport 中立层，不依赖 React、Vue、bundler 或 Module\nFederation。它可以与 `@fronts/mf`、自定义 loader 或两者同时组合。"},"189":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core","content":"Fronts 当前处于 alpha；2.0 stable 前协议和 API 仍可能变化。"},"190":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#定义应用","content":"应用只声明能力并实现 lifecycle；Host 决定真实服务、目标和 identity。producer 必须在 target 内渲染，\n并在 unmount 中释放自己拥有的 root、listener、timer 和 subscription。"},"191":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#公开能力面","content":"主入口导出："},"192":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#公开能力面","content":"`defineApp()` 与协议校验；"},"193":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#公开能力面","content":"`createFrontsHost()` 与 mounted-instance controls；"},"194":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#公开能力面","content":"static、registry、cached 与 fallback resolver；"},"195":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#公开能力面","content":"DOM/Shadow DOM container；"},"196":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#公开能力面","content":"在 loader 选择之前执行的 resolution-aware container planning；"},"197":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#公开能力面","content":"静态和实例提供的 capability-scoped services；"},"198":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#公开能力面","content":"供 resolver、loader、container 使用的 correlated operation context；"},"199":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#公开能力面","content":"typed error、lifecycle event、readiness replacement 与 leak audit。"},"200":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/core-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/core#公开能力面","content":"额外入口 `@fronts/core/iframe` 提供 origin-bound iframe container/proxy、child agent 与协商式 RPC\ncapability。接入前请阅读 Host Runtime API 与\nIframe 部署，尤其是 cleanup、exact origin 和 browser policy。"},"201":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","type":"page","content":"@fronts/mf","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","软件包","软件包"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/mf"},"202":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","content":"把已经解析的 Fronts 应用映射到显式官方 Module Federation Runtime instance 的适配器。"},"203":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/mf#创建适配器","content":"创建适配器"},"204":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/mf#remote-绑定规则","content":"Remote 绑定规则"},"205":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/mf#边界与生命周期","content":"边界与生命周期"},"206":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","content":"`@fronts/mf` 是 Fronts application 对 Module Federation 2 Runtime 的 transport adapter。"},"207":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","content":"`@module-federation/runtime` 是 peer dependency。调用者必须创建并传入显式官方 Runtime instance；\nadapter 不创建、不发现进程全局默认 instance。Fronts 当前处于 alpha，2.0 stable 前 API 可能变化。"},"208":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/mf#创建适配器","content":"每个 resolved application 只通过公开 instance method 调用 `registerRemotes()`、\n`preloadRemote()` 和 `loadRemote()`。adapter 不解析 manifest、不选择 shared dependency、不修改\nsnapshot，也不导入 `@module-federation/runtime-core`；这些都是官方 Runtime 职责。"},"209":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/mf#remote-绑定规则","content":"官方 Runtime 在同名 remote 未指定 `force` 再注册时保留第一次绑定。adapter 因此会记录自己在同一\ninstance 上观察到的 registration，并拒绝把同一 remote name 换成不同 source 或已知 resolved\nversion。应使用 deployment-specific、不可变 remote name；只有确实要替换 Runtime cache 时才显式\n使用 force，普通版本发布更适合 registry promotion + Fronts replacement transaction。"},"210":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/mf#remote-绑定规则","content":"remote module 必须默认导出有效 `FrontsApp`，通常 expose 为 `./application`。单独导出组件或官方\nBridge app 不会自动满足 Fronts ABI；需要先由对应 producer adapter 形成完整 mount/update/unmount\n契约。完整 producer 兼容范围见 Module Federation 集成。"},"211":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/mf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/mf#边界与生命周期","content":"resolver 负责从逻辑 ref 选择具体 source，MF adapter 只负责 transport load，Host 负责验证、service\nscope、container、ready 与 cleanup。显式 instance 让一个 shell 可以控制 plugin、share scope 和\ntransport lifecycle，也避免多个 Host 意外共享隐藏全局状态。Host dispose 之后，composition root\n仍需单独释放自己创建的 Runtime plugin 或外部 client 资源。"},"212":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/react","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/react","type":"page","content":"@fronts/react","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","软件包","软件包"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/react"},"213":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/react-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/react","content":"面向框架无关 Fronts 应用契约的 React producer 与 Host 适配器。"},"214":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/react-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/react","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/react#producer","content":"Producer"},"215":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/react-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/react","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/react#react-host","content":"React Host"},"216":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/react-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/react","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/react#container-与职责","content":"Container 与职责"},"217":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/react-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/react","content":"`@fronts/react` 让 React 应用参与 Fronts Host ABI；若纯 MF React 架构只需要框架/路由集成，应先\n评估官方 `@module-federation/bridge-react`。Fronts 当前为 alpha，stable 前协议与 API 可能变化。"},"218":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/react-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/react#producer","content":"`defineReactApp()` 拥有 React root、commit-based readiness、props update、context、error boundary、\n可选 Strict Mode 与 unmount。render error 会 reject 当前 lifecycle operation 并显示配置 fallback；\n之后一次有效 update 会重建 boundary，允许恢复。返回对象可以作为 MF expose，也可通过任意 Fronts\nloader 加载。`useHostServices()`、identity 和 abort signal hooks 只读取当前 scope，不能绕过 Host 授权。"},"219":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/react-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/react#react-host","content":"`RemoteApp` 管理 React 组件与 Host 实例生命周期；`useRemoteApp()` 适合 headless integration。\n组件 unmount 时会清理对应 Fronts instance，错误进入 fallback，loading 持续到应用真正 ready。"},"220":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/react-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/react#container-与职责","content":"`container` 接收静态 request，或在 resolved deployment 出现后异步生成 request 的 resolver。因此\nReact shell 可以根据 registry metadata 选择 DOM、Shadow DOM 或 iframe，而不需要改变 producer。"},"221":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/react-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/react#container-与职责","content":"React adapter 不接管 resolver、MF manifest、shared dependency、release channel 或 Host service\nauthorization。这些分别属于 Fronts Host 与 Module Federation。producer 只负责框架 root、readiness、\nprop commit 和框架级 cleanup，并最终导出同一个框架无关应用协议。"},"222":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","type":"page","content":"@fronts/vue3","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","软件包","软件包"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3"},"223":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","content":"面向框架无关 Fronts 应用契约的 Vue 3 producer 与 Host 适配器。"},"224":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3#producer","content":"Producer"},"225":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3#vue-host","content":"Vue Host"},"226":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3#container-与职责","content":"Container 与职责"},"227":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","content":"`@fronts/vue3` 让 Vue 3 应用实现 Fronts Host ABI。纯 MF Vue 架构若只需要框架与 router 集成，应先\n评估官方 `@module-federation/bridge-vue3`。Fronts 当前为 alpha，2.0 stable 前 API 可能变化。"},"228":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3#producer","content":"`defineVueApp()` 拥有 Vue app、Fronts provide context、reactive prop update、`nextTick()` readiness、\n可选 application configure 与 unmount。它同时支持 Element 和 ShadowRoot target；对于 shadow target\n会建立合适的内部挂载元素。identity、abort signal 和 scoped Host service 通过 composable 取得，\n仍受 Host declaration/policy 限制。"},"229":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3#vue-host","content":"也可使用 `useRemoteApp()` composable 进行 headless integration。loading 持续到 Fronts readiness，\nerror slot 接 lifecycle failure，Vue component 清理时卸载 Host instance。"},"230":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3#container-与职责","content":"`container` prop 可是静态 request，也可是根据 `resolved` 异步生成的 resolver，并在 Fronts 选择\nloader 前完成。这样同一 Vue producer 可在 DOM、Shadow DOM 或 iframe 执行。"},"231":{"id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/packages/vue3#container-与职责","content":"adapter 只拥有 Vue root、reactive props、commit readiness 和框架 cleanup；resolver、release policy、\nservice authorization、replacement 与 MF loading 仍属于 Host/transport 层。它输出的不是 Vue 专用\nHost 模式，而是和 core、React producer 相同的框架无关 Fronts application contract。"},"232":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","type":"page","content":"参与 Fronts 开发","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","运维与发布","运维与发布"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing"},"233":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","content":"Fronts contributor 的开发环境、变更边界、测试、文档、Changesets 与评审要求。"},"234":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#环境与仓库地图","content":"环境与仓库地图"},"235":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#变更流程与-changesets","content":"变更流程与 Changesets"},"236":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#检查命令","content":"检查命令"},"237":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#公开-api-与-mf-变更","content":"公开 API 与 MF 变更"},"238":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#iframe安全与文档","content":"Iframe、安全与文档"},"239":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#交付清单","content":"交付清单"},"240":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#环境与仓库地图","content":"需要 Node.js 22.18+、Corepack 管理的 pnpm 10/11，以及 Playwright Chromium。CI 在 Node 22 与 24\n运行主检查。用 `corepack enable` 与 `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` 安装，不要用 npm/Yarn 改写 lockfile。"},"241":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#环境与仓库地图","content":"`packages/core` 负责协议、Host、resolver、container、service、error 与 iframe；`packages/mf` 只适配\n官方公开 Runtime API；React/Vue3 包生产同一契约；`examples` 是可执行集成证据，`e2e` 在 dev/preview\n复用行为，`docs` 记录 architecture/contract/operations/runbook，`.changeset` 保存发布说明。修改 package\n边界或 lifecycle 前先读架构和应用契约。"},"242":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#变更流程与-changesets","content":"从最新分支开始并确认 worktree 不含他人变更；先复现行为或定义契约；一次改变一个 concern 并补最窄\n证明；同步所有相关 README、contract、architecture、runbook 与 example；公开 package 对 consumer\n可见时添加 changeset；迭代时跑 focused check，交付前跑完整 gate；最后检查 unrelated formatting、\ngenerated output、secret 与意外 API expansion。commit 应可独立评审，常用 `fix(core): ...`、\n`feat(mf): ...`、`test(examples): ...`、`docs: ...`。"},"243":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#变更流程与-changesets","content":"`pnpm changeset` 选择全部受影响 package，描述用户影响。runtime behavior、error、export、type、peer\nrange、metadata、安全修复需要；纯内部重构通常不需要；test/example-only 不需要；非 package README 的\ndocs-only 不需要；会随 package 发布且实质改变指南的 README 应有。不要手工改 version/changelog。"},"244":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#检查命令","content":"迭代可运行单个 Vitest 文件，但 focused test 不能代替完整 `pnpm check`。首次浏览器测试安装 Chromium："},"245":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#检查命令","content":"CI 要求 fresh production preview。修改 Host orchestration、remote output、asset URL、manifest、shared、\niframe、framework adapter 或 example server 时两套都跑。OriginJS dev 刻意是 build + preview，不是\nbundleless remote dev。"},"246":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#公开-api-与-mf-变更","content":"公开 API 完成条件：只从预期 package exports 导出；contract test 覆盖成功、失败、取消、cleanup；\nREADME/guide 解释意图与边界；ID/envelope/context 遵循 validation/snapshot；packed ESM/CJS 仍通过；有\nChangeset；stable 前评审 compatibility/rollback。不要增加绕过 Host transaction 的 convenience API；\n独立开发也用 static resolver + local loader 组合正常 Host。"},"247":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#公开-api-与-mf-变更","content":"`@fronts/mf` 必须只调用公开官方 instance method，不得解析/修改 manifest/snapshot、导入 runtime-core、\n实现 shared selection、发现 hidden global instance 或把 bundler-specific behavior 放入 core。新 producer\n声明必须证明 ready、service、update、unmount、idle、production output，以及适用时 shared behavior；\nload-only smoke 不够。"},"248":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#iframe安全与文档","content":"iframe/identity/capability/service scope 属于安全敏感变更：保持 exact origin、不用 `*`；专用 child origin\n与必需 sandbox；同时校验 origin/source；random channel 与单一 port；grant 是 maximum、Host 授权、child\n声明交集；parent 每次 privileged call 验证；abort/unmount revoke，并确定性清理 provider、peer、agent、\ncontainer。必须跑完整 iframe 单测和跨源 E2E，并人工安全评审。"},"249":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#iframe安全与文档","content":"文档记录意图、所有权、不变量、trade-off 和 verification，而不是逐行复述实现。新 canonical doc 需要\nYAML type/title/description/owner/status，未接受承诺为 proposed；链接 source/test；包含 Verification；加入\nindex；只有真正澄清复杂关系时用 Mermaid；跑 docs check 与 Prettier。当前 2.0 文档不加入旧版迁移内容。"},"250":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/contributing#交付清单","content":"确认 concern 单一、success/failure/cancellation/cleanup 证据齐全、`pnpm check` 通过、文档检查通过、相关\n两套 E2E 通过、公开包有 changeset、兼容矩阵边界精确、安全变更人工评审、输出无凭证/tenant data，\n且 commit history 可审查。普通问题走 GitHub issue 并附 troubleshooting 证据；漏洞绝不能公开，遵循\n安全策略。"},"251":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","type":"page","content":"双语文档网站规范","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","运维与发布","运维与发布"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website"},"252":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","content":"fronts.js.org 的内容、静态导出、搜索、验证、部署、rollout 与 rollback 契约。"},"253":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#问题与目标","content":"问题与目标"},"254":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#内容契约","content":"内容契约"},"255":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#读者契约","content":"读者契约"},"256":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#验收条件","content":"验收条件"},"257":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#rolloutrollback-与风险","content":"Rollout、rollback 与风险"},"258":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#验证","content":"验证"},"259":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#问题与目标","content":"仓库 canonical Markdown 适合 maintainer，但缺少可搜索、易导航且完整双语的阅读体验。旧 `gh-pages`\n是过时 Docusaurus build，也不是由当前 Fronts 2.0 contract 生成。"},"260":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#问题与目标","content":"目标是在 `main` 维护 Fumadocs source，静态导出后发布到 `https://fronts.js.org/`，以中英文覆盖应用\nABI、Host Runtime、MF 边界、隔离、package、运维、兼容性、故障排查、贡献、发布和安全。"},"261":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#内容契约","content":"`website/content/content-map.json` 是唯一 inventory，每个 slug 必须恰有一个 English 与一个 Chinese\npage。canonical English technical content 从 repository docs 和 public package README 同步；只有源文件\n不是完整英文 web article 时才允许 authored English override。中文逐页人工维护，不机器 fallback 到英文。"},"262":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#内容契约","content":"`website/content/docs` 是 ignored/generated output，不能直接编辑。精确 API、package export、engine 与\npeer range 仍以 source/manifest 为准。generator 可以把 repo-relative link 改写成本地化 route 或 GitHub\n`main` link，但不得形成第二套 API contract。"},"263":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#读者契约","content":"`/` 显式提供中英文入口；`/en/`、`/zh/` 是本地化 overview；`/en/docs/`、`/zh/docs/` 是结构完全\n平行的导航树并兼容 trailing slash。文章输出 canonical/alternate metadata；英文使用 static Orama，\n中文使用 Mandarin tokenizer；Mermaid client-side render；每个 application HTML 带完整 source revision；\nlayout 可跳转到 `main` 上对应 source。"},"264":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#读者契约","content":"不根据 cookie 或 browser language 隐式 redirect。显式 locale route 让 GitHub Pages export 可确定，\n缓存与共享链接也更稳定。"},"265":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#验收条件","content":"生成 22 对英文/中文页面，并拒绝 `docs` 任意层级未映射 canonical doc。"},"266":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#验收条件","content":"每页有 title、description、sourcePath、实质内容和多个 section；中文包含中文且不回链到英文文档树。"},"267":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#验收条件","content":"全新 `next build` 导出 root、两个 home、44 个文档 route 和 static search。"},"268":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#验收条件","content":"output check 证明 route/asset 存在、HTML lang 与 revision 正确、双语 search 含 Host guide。"},"269":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#验收条件","content":"Chromium E2E 证明语言入口、两棵 doc tree、深层 runtime article 与中英文搜索。"},"270":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#验收条件","content":"只有 clean 且等于 `origin/main` 的 main commit 可以部署。"},"271":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#验收条件","content":"deployment byte-for-byte 保留原 CNAME，只发布 export + `.nojekyll`，commit 无 parent。"},"272":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#验收条件","content":"branch 更新用 exact force lease，验证 remote SHA，并等 domain 提供嵌入 revision 后才成功。"},"273":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#rolloutrollback-与风险","content":"首次 rollout 仅在本地验证通过且 main push 成功后替换旧 branch。脚本输出 previous/new SHA；原 CNAME\n保持不变，Pages 继续使用当前 custom domain。文档回归应在 main fix/revert 后重新部署。紧急服务故障可\n从已知良好 main revision 重建并以 exact lease 发布，不把旧 Docusaurus 当正常 rollback。"},"274":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#rolloutrollback-与风险","content":"破坏性 branch rewrite 与 public domain 更新是高风险外部副作用。评审必须确认 source revision、lease、\nCNAME bytes、parent count、tree inventory、domain response 与 Pages 仍从 gh-pages root 发布。内容侧主要\n风险是 mapping stale、中文假 fallback、generated link 失效和过度兼容承诺；inventory、localized link、\nsearch、E2E 与 support vocabulary 降低风险，但技术翻译仍需 maintainer review。"},"275":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/documentation-website#验证","content":"授权部署后，还要确认 remote gh-pages 没有 parent、CNAME 精确一致、线上 `/en/docs/` 暴露 main revision，\n并人工评审 repository Pages setting、TLS 和首次公开渲染。"},"276":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","type":"page","content":"发布 Fronts","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","运维与发布","运维与发布"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing"},"277":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","content":"Changesets、本地和 CI 验证、npm trusted publishing 初始化、预发布与 stable 门禁。"},"278":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#添加变更","content":"添加变更"},"279":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#本地发布验证","content":"本地发布验证"},"280":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#自动发布流程","content":"自动发布流程"},"281":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#离开-prerelease-mode","content":"离开 prerelease mode"},"282":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#验证与人工门禁","content":"验证与人工门禁"},"283":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","content":"Fronts 同步发布 `@fronts/core`、`@fronts/mf`、`@fronts/react` 和 `@fronts/vue3` 四个公开 package。\n仓库当前处于 Changesets prerelease mode，npm tag 为 `next`。"},"284":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#添加变更","content":"每个用户可见 package 变更都需要 changeset："},"285":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#添加变更","content":"选择受影响 package 与 semantic impact，并描述 consumer 影响而不是实现细节。四包属于 fixed group，\n因此在协议稳定期间保持公开版本同步；不要手工编辑版本或 changelog。"},"286":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#本地发布验证","content":"`pnpm check` 执行 format/lint、topological clean build、tarball consumer、TypeScript、unit/integration 与\ncoverage threshold。`pnpm verify:packages` 打包每个公开 workspace，拒绝缺失 README/LICENSE/dist 或\n泄露 src/test，再在隔离临时 consumer 中通过 ESM 与 CommonJS 导入所有 entry。dev E2E 捕获实时组合\n问题，production preview 全新构建后验证最终 manifest、entry、chunk 和 share fallback，是 CI release gate。"},"287":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#自动发布流程","content":"push 到 `master` 会运行 Changesets action：有 pending changeset 时创建/更新 release PR；合并该 PR 后\n执行 `pnpm release` 并发布。GitHub environment 应把此 repo 与精确 `release.yml` 配置为 npm trusted\npublisher。workflow 使用 Node 24、OIDC-capable npm、`id-token: write` 和 provenance，且不缓存发布依赖。"},"288":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#自动发布流程","content":"npm trusted publishing 只能在 package 已存在后配置。第一次发布前：确认 publisher 拥有 `@fronts`\nscope；按安全策略启用并测试 GitHub Private Vulnerability Reporting；创建短期 granular npm token 作为\n`NPM_TOKEN`；从受保护 workflow 发布首个 prerelease；给四包配置 `unadlib/fronts` + `release.yml`\ntrusted publisher；最后删除 secret 并吊销 bootstrap token。之后依赖 OIDC 短期 credential，不保留长期\ntoken fallback。`master` 应保护 Node 22/24 checks 与 Chromium E2E。"},"289":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#自动发布流程","content":"文档站源码位于 `main`、静态站部署到 `gh-pages`，不会改变 package release 仍以 `master` 为源的规则。"},"290":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#离开-prerelease-mode","content":"协议达到 stable compatibility criteria 后："},"291":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#离开-prerelease-mode","content":"在 pull request 中审查 stable version 和 changelog。最终候选未通过 compatibility、security、browser、\npacked consumer 与 rollback gate 时，不得发布 `latest`。"},"292":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/releasing#验证与人工门禁","content":"`pnpm check` 是非浏览器 release gate，两套 E2E 分别验证开发组合和全新生产 artifact。CI/release workflow\n是自动化权威来源；支持策略与\n安全策略列出的外部配置和 maintainer acceptance 不能由本地测试替代。"},"293":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","type":"page","content":"运行时运维","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","运维与发布","运维与发布"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations"},"294":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","content":"Fronts Host 的可观测性、失败处理、替换、timeout、测试证据与事故关联。"},"295":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#可观测模型","content":"可观测模型"},"296":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#订阅与指标","content":"订阅与指标"},"297":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"失败语义"},"298":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#audit-与关闭","content":"Audit 与关闭"},"299":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#替换-runbook-与-timeout","content":"替换 runbook 与 timeout"},"300":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#测试与事故关联","content":"测试与事故关联"},"301":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#可观测模型","content":"每个 Host 有 `hostId`，每个应用有 `instanceId` 与 `traceId`。Host event 包含单调 sequence、timestamp\n和当前 snapshot；state event 还带上一状态 duration，error event 带稳定 code 与 phase。每次 resolve、\nload、preload、mount、replace 是一个 operation，扩展收到相同且不可变的 `operationId`、hostId、\ntraceId、intent、signal，以及存在实例时由 Host 颁发的 identity。"},"302":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#可观测模型","content":"mount/replace 的 resolver 在版本未知前就看到 identity；resolution 后的 context 与 identity 会被冻结\n并补充版本。扩展必须用 ID 关联，不能依赖 object identity。Host 快照自己拥有的 ref、context、policy、\nresolved envelope 和 container request；opaque source、props、services、signal、DOM target 仍由各领域\n所有者管理。动态 container resolver 在 resolution 后、loader 选择前运行并立即快照结果。"},"303":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#可观测模型","content":"公开 phase 是 `resolve`、`load`、`container`、`mount`、`ready`、`update`、`activate`、`deactivate`、\n`unmount`。replacement 由这些 phase 组成，audit 是同步报告而不是 error phase。MF manifest、entry、\nexpose、shared 和 resource hook 属于官方 Runtime；在 `@fronts/mf` load boundary 关联两条 trace，\n不要把所有 MF payload 复制到 core。"},"304":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#订阅与指标","content":"observer 必须非阻塞且不得抛错；通过 buffered client 发出，并移除 props、service argument、带凭证 URL\n和敏感 tenant metadata。建议监控 resolution、MF load/preload、mount-to-ready、update/activation、\nreplacement、active instance、stale cache、capability denial、iframe handshake/RPC timeout/origin rejection、\nretained container 与 non-idle audit。instance/trace ID 只放 trace/log，metric 按 app、version、phase、\ncontainer、error code 聚合。"},"305":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"Fronts 用 `FrontsError` 包装失败，包含稳定 code、责任 phase、原始 cause 和无需解析 message 的 details。"},"306":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"失败"},"307":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"Host 行为"},"308":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"resolution/registry"},"309":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"使用已配置 cache/fallback，否则 reject"},"310":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"MF load"},"311":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"回滚已取得资源；replacement 当前目标保持活跃"},"312":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"无效协议"},"313":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"mount 前拒绝"},"314":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"container prepare"},"315":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"revoke service、dispose provider、reject"},"316":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"mount/ready/timeout"},"317":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"尽可能 unmount，再 dispose scope/container"},"318":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"update"},"319":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"实例仍 mounted，向调用者暴露失败"},"320":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"replacement staging"},"321":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"销毁 staging，保留 current"},"322":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"commit 后旧实例 cleanup"},"323":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"返回 `previousCleanupError`，新实例仍 committed"},"324":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"任一不完整 cleanup"},"325":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"保留 `cleanupError`，audit/dispose 失败"},"326":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"observer 抛错"},"327":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#失败语义","content":"runtime 继续，observer 不在事务内"},"328":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#audit-与关闭","content":"`inspect()` 返回 live transaction 和因无法证明 cleanup 而保留的 terminal record。`audit()` 进一步\n报告 active instance、cleanup failure、pending operation、replacement transaction、retained owned\ncontainer 和总体 idle。direct resolve/load/preload 也在 pending 中，并会在 Host dispose 时 abort。"},"329":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#audit-与关闭","content":"测试、route teardown 和 shell shutdown 后执行："},"330":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#audit-与关闭","content":"`dispose()` abort direct operation，abort/unmount instance，等待 replacement 与 late cleanup，再释放\nHost 资源。如果 cleanup failure 或 owned container 仍 attached，会以 `FRONTS_RUNTIME_LEAK` reject；\n查看 audit 的 cleanupFailures/retainedContainers 找到 owner。transport-specific object 仍由 composition\nroot 单独 dispose。"},"331":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#替换-runbook-与-timeout","content":"确认新旧 registry response 和不可变 artifact；可预加载候选但不把 preload 当 ready；带稳定 product\ntrace 和全新 resolution context 调 replace；staging 失败时验证旧实例仍活跃；commit 后若有\npreviousCleanupError，继续服务新实例但按泄漏事故处理；确认 old container 不再 retained；业务验证\n失败则回退 registry/channel 后再次 replace，不能原地重写 active artifact。"},"332":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#替换-runbook-与-timeout","content":"所有 timeout 必须有限非负，`0` 只关闭 deadline；生产 readiness 来自实际 SLO，iframe handshake/RPC\n保持有限，registry fetch/custom loader 继续传 signal。timeout 必须触发 cleanup，绝不能留下 hidden app。"},"333":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#测试与事故关联","content":"证据分五层：protocol/resolver/service/adapter 单测；Host lifecycle/cancellation/replacement/audit contract；\n真实 HTTP remote + 官方 MF Runtime 集成；core-only 与 React/Vue/iframe Chromium E2E；官方及兼容 Vite\nproducer E2E。`pnpm test:e2e` 测 dev server，`pnpm test:e2e:preview` 全新构建后测生产产物，CI 使用后者。"},"334":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/runtime-operations#测试与事故关联","content":"事故中同时记录 hostId、operationId/intent、traceId、instanceId、app/version/expose、container type、\nregistry deployment/policy revision、MF instance/remote/entry 与 Fronts phase/code，便于把所有权定位到\n部署策略、MF 资源、producer render、容器或 Host service。"},"335":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","type":"page","content":"Fronts 安全策略","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","运维与发布","运维与发布"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/security"},"336":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security","content":"Fronts 的漏洞范围、私密报告要求、披露处理与安全发布门禁。"},"337":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#私密报告漏洞","content":"私密报告漏洞"},"338":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#范围内边界","content":"范围内边界"},"339":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#范围外与研究者责任","content":"范围外与研究者责任"},"340":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#支持版本","content":"支持版本"},"341":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#maintainer-响应与披露","content":"Maintainer 响应与披露"},"342":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#首次发布前人工门禁","content":"首次发布前人工门禁"},"343":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#私密报告漏洞","content":"不要在 GitHub issue、discussion、PR、社交媒体或其他公开渠道发布漏洞技术细节。预期渠道是 GitHub\nSecurity 页中的 **Report a vulnerability**，私密提交影响、复现、受影响版本与建议缓解。"},"344":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#私密报告漏洞","content":"`unadlib/fronts` 当前尚未启用 Private Vulnerability Reporting，因此还没有已经验证的私密技术入口。\n启用前，报告者只能创建不含任何细节的公开 issue：“Private security contact requested”，不能附 PoC、\n受影响 URL、secret 或 exploit；等待 maintainer 建立私密渠道后再分享。启用并实际测试 PVR 是首次公开\nFronts 2.0 package 的 release blocker。"},"345":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#私密报告漏洞","content":"私密报告应包含 package/commit/entry/runtime mode，Host/producer/browser/framework/MF/plugin 版本，跨越的\n安全边界与现实影响，最小 PoC、步骤/权限/交互，redacted Fronts/MF trace，涉及 DOM/origin/capability/\nidentity/shared/artifact 的说明，以及 workaround 和协调披露限制。绝不要发送真实 credential、token、\ncookie、private key、生产个人数据或未脱敏 tenant metadata。"},"346":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#范围内边界","content":"以下 Fronts 行为属于范围：接受伪造/不支持的 FrontsApp 或 iframe protocol；服务超出应用声明和 Host\n授权；把 child-supplied identity/tenant 当可信授权；abort/unmount 后仍能使用 revoked facade；接受\n禁止 origin/错误 parent window；built-in container 接受通配/不匹配 targetOrigin；畸形 RPC 绕过 grant；\n跨实例 lifecycle/service/identity/container/channel 混淆；不安全 source mutation/registration reuse 跨越\nresolved boundary；package export/provenance/release automation 发布非预期 artifact；Host 报成功 unmount\n后 privileged channel/provider/app 仍活跃。"},"347":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#范围内边界","content":"边界详情见隔离与安全和\nIframe 部署。"},"348":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#范围外与研究者责任","content":"单纯存在于 React、Vue、MF、bundler、browser 或 producer plugin、且 Fronts 未引入/绕过边界的漏洞；\n应用业务逻辑/服务端授权；部署主动关闭 CSP/origin/sandbox/TLS/capability 要求；恶意应用使用 Host 明确\n授予的 ambient 权限；已被信任在 parent realm 任意执行的应用造成 DoS；unsupported deep import/runtime/\nbrowser/producer；或需要越权访问/披露 secret 的发现，本身不构成 Fronts 漏洞。若 Fronts 能提供有效\ndefense、safer default、detection 或文档，仍可私密报告并说明 Fronts-specific impact。"},"349":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#范围外与研究者责任","content":"研究者只能测试自己拥有或获授权的系统与数据，最小化收集/留存，一旦可能影响可用性、其他用户或\n生产完整性就停止；不得社会工程、物理攻击、撞库、破坏或无界 DoS；修复前保持私密并给合理响应时间。\n本策略不授予第三方系统权限，也不承诺法律 safe harbor。"},"350":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#支持版本","content":"Fronts 2.0 尚未发布；欢迎针对当前 `master` 的报告，但没有已发 2.0 artifact 可 patch。当前 unreleased\n2.0 接受报告并在 master 修复；首次 prerelease 后只计划支持最新 `next`；stable 2.x 维护窗口尚未接受；\n旧 package line 不在本策略支持范围。每次 release-line/maintenance-policy 变化必须同步此表与支持策略。"},"351":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#maintainer-响应与披露","content":"maintainer 应在 private advisory 确认并指派 owner；在受支持/候选配置复现；识别 trust boundary 与版本；\n评估 CIA、权限和 exploitability；可行时加 regression test；在 private fork/受控 branch 修复；验证 tarball、\nlifecycle cleanup、相关 browser E2E 与 rollback；协调 release/advisory/credit/CVE；同步发布修复与 advisory；\n最后更新版本表和架构/威胁/runbook。prerelease 暂无量化 SLA，stable 前必须接受 owner 与响应目标。"},"352":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#maintainer-响应与披露","content":"未修复前不在 public commit/issue 讨论 exploit。security release 必须有 Changeset、affected/fixed version、\nprovenance 与受保护 workflow。上游漏洞先遵循上游私密流程；披露后只保留持久架构经验，不把 exploit\nsecret 写入普通文档。"},"353":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#首次发布前人工门禁","content":"启用 GitHub Private Vulnerability Reporting，并提交无害测试报告验证收发。"},"354":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#首次发布前人工门禁","content":"指派 security response owner 与 backup，决定确认/修复目标。"},"355":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#首次发布前人工门禁","content":"接受 supported-version 和 coordinated-disclosure policy，决定是否需要独立安全邮箱。"},"356":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#首次发布前人工门禁","content":"运行 iframe/services 高风险测试、`pnpm check` 与 production-preview E2E。"},"357":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/security-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/security#首次发布前人工门禁","content":"API 检查必须返回 `{\"enabled\":true}` 后才能发布。仓库测试不能替代 report intake、severity、披露时间、\n受影响版本和部署 CSP/cookie/origin 的人工判断。"},"358":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","type":"page","content":"支持策略","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","运维与发布","运维与发布"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy"},"359":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","content":"Fronts 2.0 对软件包、运行时、框架、浏览器、模块格式与预发布版本的支持边界。"},"360":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"支持术语"},"361":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"Package 与 toolchain"},"362":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#浏览器与运行环境","content":"浏览器与运行环境"},"363":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#mf-producer-与公开-package-contract","content":"MF producer 与公开 package contract"},"364":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#prerelease-与-stable-gate","content":"Prerelease 与 stable gate"},"365":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#报告兼容问题与验证","content":"报告兼容问题与验证"},"366":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","content":"Fronts 2.0 尚未发布。stable 前公开 API、package boundary 和 protocol 可能变化，但所有用户可见 package\n变更仍必须有 Changeset。package manifest 的精确 engine/peer range 最权威；本文解释“声明”与“验证”\n的区别，一个绿色 fixture 只证明一个组合，不证明整个相邻版本空间。"},"367":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"术语"},"368":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"含义"},"369":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"Declared support"},"370":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"位于发布 package engine/peer range 内，回归按 Fronts issue 处理"},"371":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"CI-verified"},"372":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"仓库在该环境运行必需 build/package/test/browser gate"},"373":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"Fixture-verified"},"374":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"只有一个 checked-in 组合通过，不推导相邻版本或模式"},"375":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"Best effort"},"376":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"可能可用、欢迎报告，但没有持续门禁"},"377":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"Unsupported"},"378":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"在 package contract 外或违反已记录边界"},"379":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#支持术语","content":"仅因为 JavaScript engine 提供某个 Web API，并不能称为 CI-verified；新声明必须有可重复检查。"},"380":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"Surface"},"381":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"声明边界"},"382":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"当前验证"},"383":{"id":"/zh/docs