3","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"TypeScript declaration"},"393":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"ESM/CJS 均输出"},"394":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"固定 compiler 的 workspace typecheck"},"395":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"MF Runtime"},"396":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"`@module-federation/runtime` `^2.7.0`"},"397":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"adapter 单测与真实 HTTP Runtime 集成"},"398":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"React"},"399":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"React/DOM `>=18.2.0 <20`"},"400":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"workspace 版本的 contract/example"},"401":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"Vue"},"402":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"`>=3.4.0 <4`"},"403":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"workspace 版本的 contract/example"},"404":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#package-与-toolchain","content":"当前没有 consumer TypeScript compiler matrix，因此不能宣称最低 TS 版本。React 18.2 与 Vue 3.4 是合法\npeer lower bound，但尚未分别 matrix-test；stable 前应新增最低版本 job，或缩窄范围。"},"405":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#浏览器与运行环境","content":"Core Host 需要 ES2022、DOM、AbortController、`Proxy.revocable`、promise 与 module/bundler output；\nShadow 路径需要 Shadow DOM；iframe 还需要 cross-origin sandbox、postMessage、transferable MessagePort、\nstructured clone 与 `crypto.randomUUID()`。框架 adapter 还受对应 React/Vue browser requirement 限制。"},"406":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#浏览器与运行环境","content":"当前 CI 只安装 Playwright Chromium，所以只有 Chromium 是 CI-verified。Firefox/WebKit 是 best effort，\n直到同一 lifecycle/replacement/service/Shadow/iframe suite 成为 required project。mobile browser、embedded\nWebView 不声明支持；IE 与非 ES2022 legacy browser 不支持。Fronts 不发 polyfill，consumer 可自行\ntranspile/polyfill，但不能削弱 exact iframe origin 或 secure channel ID。"},"407":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#浏览器与运行环境","content":"浏览器 shell + DOM 是主要 target。Node ESM/CommonJS 只验证公开 entry 可导入，不代表能 mount DOM。\nSSR/hydration、Web/Service Worker、React Native/native WebView 不支持；Deno/Bun build runtime 为 best effort。"},"408":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#mf-producer-与公开-package-contract","content":"官方 Rsbuild/官方 Vite 是首选集成；未加 scope 的 `vite-plugin-federation` 是 verified producer\ncompatibility；OriginJS 是锁定 Vite 5.4 的 production ESM narrow fixture；所有 MF Host 都使用显式\n官方 Runtime instance。插件 README 或 peer range 不会自动成为 Fronts 支持声明。新增 producer/version\n必须用 fixture 证明完整 lifecycle、service、cleanup 和适用时 shared behavior。"},"409":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#mf-producer-与公开-package-contract","content":"唯一支持的 entry 是 `@fronts/core`、`@fronts/core/iframe`、`@fronts/mf`、`@fronts/react`、\n`@fronts/vue3`。深导入 `dist`、`src`、runtime-core 或其他私有文件不支持。ESM import 与 CommonJS\nrequire 都是 package gate；四个公开 package 通过 Changesets fixed group 同步版本。application 与 iframe\nprotocol major 是运行时兼容门禁，伪造 brand 或绕过 validation 不支持。"},"410":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#prerelease-与-stable-gate","content":"stable 前可能 breaking，四包一起移动；consumer 应 pin 精确 prerelease/受控 lockfile，并在生产 rollout\n前测试自己的 Host、producer、browser、policy 组合。第一次发布后 npm `next` 才表示 prerelease；当前\n没有已发布 2.0 package。"},"411":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#prerelease-与-stable-gate","content":"发布 `latest` 前必须完成：公开 protocol/entry compatibility review；tarball ESM/CJS/declaration/subpath\n检查；每个声明 minimum framework/runtime 持续验证或缩窄；browser matrix 明确且绿色；iframe origin、\ncapability、cancellation、timeout、cleanup 为 required test；production-preview 覆盖全部 producer tier；\nprovenance、rollback 和 vulnerability intake 实际可运行。之后才按 semver 在 minor 加兼容能力、patch 修复、\nnew major 破坏契约。"},"412":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#报告兼容问题与验证","content":"报告应含 Fronts 版本/lock、Node/browser/framework/MF/plugin 版本、manifest 或 raw entry 与格式、dev/preview\n差异、最小 ref/source/container、Fronts code/phase/event、redacted MF trace、unmount 后 audit，以及最小\nreproduction。安全问题必须走安全策略，不能公开发布。"},"413":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/support-policy#报告兼容问题与验证","content":"`pnpm check` 覆盖格式、构建、tarball、类型、单测和 coverage；`pnpm test:e2e:preview` 重建当前 producer\nmatrix 并在 Chromium 验证。上述缺失 matrix 必须如实标成 Missing，不能宣传为 CI-verified。"},"414":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Fronts Runtime 故障排查","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","运维与发布","运维与发布"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting"},"415":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","content":"按错误 phase、稳定 code、MF 加载、capability、iframe 与 cleanup 证据定位运行时故障。"},"416":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"从哪里开始"},"417":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#resolution-故障","content":"Resolution 故障"},"418":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#module-federation-与-loader","content":"Module Federation 与 loader"},"419":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#无效应用与-container","content":"无效应用与 container"},"420":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#capability-与-service","content":"Capability 与 service"},"421":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#mountready-与-lifecycle","content":"Mount、ready 与 lifecycle"},"422":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#iframe","content":"Iframe"},"423":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#non-idle-audit-与恢复","content":"Non-idle audit 与恢复"},"424":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"保留原始 `FrontsError`，按 `code` 与 `phase` 分类，不要解析 message。先查看 `cause`、Host event、\n`inspect()` 和 `audit()`；replacement 的 staging failure 按实际 phase 诊断，而\n`previousCleanupError` 表示新实例已经 commit、旧实例 unmount 失败。"},"425":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"Code family"},"426":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"第一检查点"},"427":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"`FRONTS_RESOLUTION_FAILED`"},"428":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"ref/policy、registry、取消、cache/fallback"},"429":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"`FRONTS_LOAD_FAILED`"},"430":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"loader、MF registration/network cause"},"431":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"`FRONTS_INVALID_APP` / `FRONTS_UNSUPPORTED_PROTOCOL`"},"432":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"producer expose 与 protocol major"},"433":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"`FRONTS_CONTAINER_FAILED`"},"434":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"request planner、adapter lookup/prepare/rollback"},"435":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"`FRONTS_IFRAME_PROTOCOL`"},"436":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"origin、sandbox、envelope、identity、grant、RPC frame"},"437":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"`FRONTS_CAPABILITY_DENIED`"},"438":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"declaration、provider、policy、iframe intersection"},"439":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"`FRONTS_MOUNT_FAILED` / `FRONTS_READY_TIMEOUT`"},"440":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"producer mount、framework commit、deadline"},"441":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"`FRONTS_LIFECYCLE_FAILED` / `FRONTS_INVALID_STATE`"},"442":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"handle callback 与当前 state"},"443":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"`FRONTS_ABORTED` / `FRONTS_HOST_DISPOSED`"},"444":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"signal owner 与 shutdown order"},"445":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"`FRONTS_RPC_TIMEOUT` / `FRONTS_RPC_CLOSED`"},"446":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"child agent 与 channel 生命周期"},"447":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"`FRONTS_RUNTIME_LEAK`"},"448":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"pending、cleanup failure、replacement、retained DOM"},"449":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#从哪里开始","content":"控制流应导入 `frontsErrorCodes`，不要重复字符串常量。"},"450":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#resolution-故障","content":"依次检查 ref 的 name/expose/range/channel 是 own、类型正确且非空；environment/tenant/cohort 来自可信\nshell policy；resolver 返回同一 normalized ref、有效 source 与非空可选 version；caller signal 或 Host\ndispose 是否中止 registry；cached/fallback 是否把授权失败错误地转成 stale hit。"},"451":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#resolution-故障","content":"用 `host.resolve(ref, context)` 单独复现。如果此处失败，MF、container、service provider 与 producer\n均未参与，不要先修改它们。"},"452":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#module-federation-与-loader","content":"manifest/entry 取不到时，从同一 browser context 打开 exact URL，检查 status、redirect、CORS、MIME、\nTLS、CSP、public base；确认 manifest 不是 HTML fallback/gateway JSON，并检查每个引用 chunk 可从 Host\n或 iframe agent origin 访问。dev 成功不证明 build output，必须比较 production preview。"},"453":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#module-federation-与-loader","content":"ESM raw entry 需要兼容的 entry type（如 `module`）；global format 需要 producer 的预期 global/container\nname。优先 manifest。仓库 OriginJS 只声明 production ESM，其 dev 命令实际 build + preview。"},"454":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#module-federation-与-loader","content":"remote/expose 不存在时，对照 source remote name/alias、`AppRef.expose` 的大小写与 `./` normalization，\n确认传入预期官方 Runtime instance，并用官方 Runtime hook/DevTools 区分 registration、manifest、entry、\nexpose 与 shared failure。同一 Runtime 中 remote name 已绑定时，使用 deployment-specific name；不要为\n消除错误盲目 force，因为 force 清理 loaded-module cache 并改变共享 runtime state。"},"455":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#module-federation-与-loader","content":"shared 版本由 MF 而非 Fronts 选择。检查两端 share scope、package/version、singleton/eager 和 fallback。\nplugin-free runtime Host 不会自动提供 producer build-time share graph；OriginJS fixture 刻意保留 core\nfallback，官方与 unscoped Vite fixture 则 bundle 小型 Fronts protocol。"},"456":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#无效应用与-container","content":"expose 必须 default-export `defineApp()`、`defineReactApp()` 或 `defineVueApp()` 的对象，并返回带\n`unmount()` 的 handle。常见问题是导出组件、错误 named/default 层、`default.default`、无 handle、\n缺 unmount、手写旧 brand/protocol。用 `host.load()` 把 resolver/loader/protocol validation 与 mount 分开。"},"457":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#无效应用与-container","content":"container 失败时确认 request 有已注册且非空 own `type`，在动态 planner 中先验证 registry metadata，\ntarget 属于 live document 且能 append，custom adapter 返回 matching type、element、mount target 与\n`dispose()`。`ownsElement` 为 true 时，partial failure 也必须 detach；传入 Host 后不要 mutate request 或\nresolved envelope。Fronts 会尝试回滚无效 prepared result，因此同时检查 validation 与 cleanup cause。"},"458":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#capability-与-service","content":"依次看 producer 声明、静态/provider 是否有 own-key service、policy 对 Host-issued identity 的判断、\n`createServices` 是否在取消前返回合法对象；iframe 再比较 proxy maximum、parent-authorized scope 与 child\ndeclaration。provider 同名值覆盖静态值，disposer 必须能处理 partial rollback 且恰好一次。"},"459":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#capability-与-service","content":"不要通过暴露所有 services “修复” denial；只增加实际需要的窄 capability、policy、argument validation\n和 audit attribution。"},"460":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#mountready-与-lifecycle","content":"mount failure 表示 service setup、producer `mount()`、handle validation 或 framework immediate setup\n失败；ready failure 表示 handle 已返回但 commit promise reject、超时或被取消。检查 framework error\nboundary/handler 与最初 render exception。readiness 必须在可用 UI commit 后 settle，不能只代表 scheduling；\n每条 mount path 即便无 update/activation 也必须返回 unmount。timeout 会回滚；只有测量 SLO 证明需要时\n才增大它，增大数值修不好永不 settle 的 promise。"},"461":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#mountready-与-lifecycle","content":"update 可选但调用缺失实现会有意失败；update/activate/deactivate 串行，先检查上一操作；unmount、abort、\nfailed 或 disposed 后不要再调用。replacement 要求 current 为 ready/active/inactive，同一实例只有一个；\nstaging failure 保留 current；previousCleanupError 继续服务新实例但调查旧资源；业务验证失败回退 registry\n后再次 replace，不覆盖已加载 MF binding。"},"462":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#iframe","content":"frame 不连接时确认 src 与 targetOrigin 是同一 exact canonical child origin，且不同于 shell；sandbox\n同时有 allow-scripts/allow-same-origin；shell 有 `crypto.randomUUID()`；child allowedOrigins 精确包含 shell，\n不含 `*`；agent bundle 在 load 前运行，且 frame-src、frame-ancestors、script/connect CSP、CORS 未阻断。"},"463":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#iframe","content":"handshake/RPC timeout 时对比 Host ready、proxy handshake、parent request、child request 四个 deadline；\n检查 child loader 是否取到 artifact、真实 app 是否 ready、两端 console、source/metadata/props/RPC payload\n是否 structured clone，以及 navigation/shutdown 是否 abort。parent 有 service 但 child 无时，检查 maximum、\nprovision/policy 和 declaration 三者，不能手动操作低层 negotiation 或 `IframeRpcPeer`。"},"464":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#non-idle-audit-与恢复","content":"`activeInstances` 通常是漏 unmount；`pendingOperations` 是 resolver/loader/provider/mount/late cleanup 未 settle；\n`replacementTransactions` 是仍在 staging/cleanup；`cleanupFailures` 属于 producer/provider/container disposer；\n`retainedContainers` 表示 terminal owned element 仍 attached。不要手工删 DOM 或丢弃 Host 来隐藏泄漏，\n修复真正 owner，并保留 audit 作为 CI gate。"},"465":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#non-idle-audit-与恢复","content":"复现顺序为 `pnpm check`、`pnpm test:e2e`、`pnpm test:e2e:preview`。事故证据要包含 ID、app/version、\ncontainer、Fronts code/phase/cause、registry/cache、MF instance/entry/trace、browser/framework/plugin/mode、\nnetwork waterfall 与失败前后 audit；不要附 token、cookie、敏感 props/tenant/service arguments。"},"466":{"id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/operations/troubleshooting#non-idle-audit-与恢复","content":"恢复优先 registry/channel rollback；网络失败仅有限 backoff + cancellation，不盲目重试执行、protocol、policy\n或 capability failure；首个失败保持主因，cleanup failure 单独保留；replacement staging 期间保持当前应用；\n即使新 UI 已服务，previousCleanupError/non-idle audit 仍按事故处理。"},"467":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","type":"page","content":"Host 运行时 API","breadcrumbs":["Fronts 2.0 文档","运行时指南","运行时指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api"},"468":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","content":"组合 Fronts Host，并使用解析、加载、生命周期、替换、观测与关闭 API 的操作指南。"},"469":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#组合边界","content":"组合边界"},"470":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#操作地图","content":"操作地图"},"471":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#解析加载和预加载","content":"解析、加载和预加载"},"472":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#挂载事务","content":"挂载事务"},"473":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#上下文服务","content":"上下文服务"},"474":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#实例控制与就绪替换","content":"实例控制与就绪替换"},"475":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#观测错误和关闭","content":"观测、错误和关闭"},"476":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#验证","content":"验证"},"477":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","content":"Host 是解析、加载、授权、挂载、替换和清理应用的唯一事务边界。精确签名以\n`packages/core/src/host/types.ts`\n为准。平台 shell、本地 producer 开发、Storybook 和集成测试应走同一条 Host 路径；独立应用只需\n静态 resolver 与本地 loader，不需要全局注册或第二套 lifecycle API。"},"478":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#组合边界","content":"composition root 拥有 Host、resolver、transport loader、container adapter、静态 services 和\ntransport runtime。resolver 只选部署，不加载代码；loader 只返回包含有效 `FrontsApp` 的 module，\n不拥有应用生命周期；container 拥有执行面和自己声明的资源；Host 拥有事务顺序、取消、readiness、\nrollback 与 audit。Shell 还必须单独 dispose 自己创建的 MF instance plugin、registry client 等资源。"},"479":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#组合边界","content":"主要配置包括必需的 `resolver`/`loader`，容器集合和按 type 覆盖的 `containerLoaders`，静态\n`services`、实例 `createServices` 与 `capabilityPolicy`，`readyTimeoutMs`，可控的 host/instance/\noperation/trace ID factory，非阻塞 observer 与测试时钟。ID factory 必须返回非空字符串；timeout\n必须有限且非负，`0` 只关闭该 deadline，不关闭取消。生产环境应从应用 SLO 设置有限值。"},"480":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#操作地图","content":"API"},"481":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#操作地图","content":"用途"},"482":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#操作地图","content":"是否创建实例"},"483":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#操作地图","content":"主要影响"},"484":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#操作地图","content":"`resolve()`"},"485":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#操作地图","content":"查看策略选出的部署"},"486":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#操作地图","content":"否"},"487":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#操作地图","content":"仅 resolver"},"488":{"id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/runtime/host-runtime-api#操作地图","content